Responsibilities

Societe Generale Global Solution Centre (SG GSC)
acts as a business solution center for Societe Generale, one of the largest European financial groups. We provide high-quality professional services for more than 35 countries in various fields of activity – Finance & Accounting, HR, IT and Corporate Operations. Our mission is to be a partner of choice, valued for owning, transforming and innovating through best in class talent. IT Filiere is part of the Centre and comprises four Perimeters: Retail Banking, Security and Infrastructure, Internal Support Applications and Investment Banking,  with a total of more than 800 IT professionals.

Project Description:

The team is part of the Equity Prime Brokerage department, which oversees the life cycle and management for DPS (Dynamic Portfolio Swap) products and is present in Paris, Bucharest, Montreal & Hong Kong. We provide services and financing that allow our customers to exchange the performance of an equity portfolio against payment of interest. These tools integrate booking, product events and payment for operations, corporate actions, valuation, position management, client reporting, access to a client platform (SG Market).

Specifically, you will be required to:

Design and develop new features front to back as part of an agile/scrum team;
Ensure the delivery of high-quality and scalable solutions using modern development practices such as clean code, automated testing, monitoring, alerting and secure by design;
Provide L3 support on application in production environment, when needed;
Maintain and improve the continuous integration and delivery environment.

Required

